{"id":"598ce7e7b39d","path":"/de/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/contacts","lang":"de","title":"Kontakt","description":"Die Studienberatung steht Ihnen für Fragen zum Master in History and Theory of Art and Architecture jederzeit zur Verfügung. Rufen Sie uns an oder schreiben Sie uns noch heute.","section":"Bildung","crumbs":["Bildung","Master","MSTAA"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-immagine_copertina_sito.jpg?itok=WqOWZYMH","words":112,"alternates":{"en":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/contacts","it":"/it/formazione/master/storia-e-teoria-di-arte-e-architettura/contatti","de":"/de/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/contacts"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Startseite","path":"/en"},{"label":"Bildung","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MSTAA","path":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture"},{"label":"Kontakt","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-immagine_copertina_sito.jpg?itok=WqOWZYMH","alt":"Titelbild Master in Storia e teoria dell'arte e dell'architettura","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Die Studienberatung steht für Orientierungsgespräche zum Studium und für allgemeine Informationen über die Universität zur Verfügung.</p> <p>Sie erreichen die Studienberatung wie folgt:</p> <ul> <li>Schalter (Via Buffi 13, Lugano, Büro 320): Montag bis Freitag, 9.00–12.00 Uhr und 14.00–17.00 Uhr</li> <li>Telefon +41 58 666 4795: vormittags von Dienstag bis Freitag, 9.00–12.00 Uhr, und nachmittags am Montag, Dienstag und Donnerstag, 14.00–17.00 Uhr.</li> <li>Persönliche Beratungen nach Vereinbarung, vor Ort oder online via Microsoft Teams, können auf <a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/book-a-meeting\">dieser Webseite</a> gebucht werden.</li> </ul> <p>Für allgemeine Anfragen können Sie das Formular ausfüllen:</p> <p><strong><a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/contact-form\">Kontakt</a></strong></p><p><strong>Für Informationen zum Studienprogramm des Masters in History and Theory of Art and Architecture wenden Sie sich bitte an: </strong></p> <p>Dr. Mirko Moizi <br> <a href=\"mailto:mstaa@usi.ch\">mstaa@usi.ch</a><br> Tel. +41 58 666 5402</p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Jetzt bewerben","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Kontakt","href":"mailto:mstaa@usi.ch?subject=BTN Learn More"}],"nav":[{"label":"Master in History and Theory of Art and Architecture","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture"},{"label":"Studienplan","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/structure-and-contents"},{"label":"Arbeitsmarktfähigkeit","href":"/en/node/34696"},{"label":"Berufsprofile","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/career-prospects"},{"label":"Arbeitgebende","href":"/en/node/34692"},{"label":"Karrieregeschichten","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/career-prospects/career-stories"},{"label":"Bewerbung und Zulassung","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/admission"},{"label":"Gebühren und Stipendien","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Infotage und Studienberatung","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/open-days-study-advisory"},{"label":"Kontakt","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/contacts"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/faq"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education/master/history-and-theory-of-art-and-architecture/contacts","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:32:19.234Z","translated":true}